          "kicker": "Table standings",
          "heading": "Fiji remain bottom of the Nations Championship table after three opening defeats",
          "body": "Fiji occupy 12th place in the Nations Championship table after three rounds of competition. The side has yet to record a win in the tournament. They have scored 49 points while conceding 145 across those three matches, leaving the squad with a current points difference of -96. Their most recent fixture resulted in a 33-17 defeat against Scotland. The Flying Fijians previously lost 34-21 to their next opponents, France, when the sides met away from home in November 2025."
