          "heading": "Ellie Kildunne and England Women host New Zealand seeking immediate WXV response",
          "body": "England Women return to Allianz Stadium today to face New Zealand in their final WXV Global Series encounter of the first window. Following a dramatic draw against Canada that ended a record 39-match winning streak last weekend, the Red Roses are searching for an immediate return to form against the world’s second-ranked side. New Zealand arrive at Twickenham following a 66-point victory over Scotland. Digital coverage is available across BBC platforms for this afternoon's meeting at the home of English rugby."
