          "heading": "Ireland Women's Aoife Wafer ruled out of upcoming Japan Test match",
          "body": "Ireland Women's back row Aoife Wafer has been ruled out of Sunday’s WXV Global Series encounter against Japan due to a minor injury sustained in training. Head coach Scott Bemand has responded by making 6 changes to his starting XV following last week’s defeat to the USA. Eilís Cahill earns her first start, while uncapped hooker Beth Buttimer is named among the replacements. Bemand noted the match serves as an opportunity to add more layers and attacking prowess to the team’s game."
