          "body": "Bath director of rugby Johann van Graan has credited Santiago Carreras' character as the Argentina full-back returns to club duty for the opening round of the 2026-27 Premiership season. Van Graan revealed that Carreras enjoyed a blistering 20-minute spell in training where he looked like the \"best player on the planet\". Describing the Argentine international as \"jovial\" and one of the best team men in the squad, the coach emphasised that the player is fully focused on what lies ahead following his international commitments with Los Pumas earlier in the year."
